sn45.146-148:3.7 starts: It is in this way, bhikkhus,
sn45.146-148:3.9 starts: Each sutta is to be elaborated in accordance
mn19:4-5.2 starts: a thought of cruelty arose in me.
mn19:9-10.2 starts: a thought of non-cruelty arose in me.
mn19:12.3 starts: so too, there was need for me only
mn19:23.3 starts: I directly knew: ‘Birth is destroyed,
mn19:25.2 starts: near which a large herd of deer lived.
an3.183-352:2.2 starts: for the utter destruction … for the abandoning …
an3.183-352:2.3 starts: for the abandoning … for the destruction …
an3.183-352:2.4 starts: for the destruction … for the vanishing …
an3.183-352:2.5 starts: for the vanishing … for the fading away …
an3.183-352:2.6 starts: for the fading away … for the cessation …
an3.183-352:2.7 starts: for the cessation … for the giving up …
an3.183-352:2.8 starts: for the giving up … For the relinquishment
an3.183-352:2.9 starts: For the relinquishment of lust, these three things
an3.183-352:3.1 starts: “Bhikkhus, for direct knowledge … for full understanding
